[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18306.708, "timestamp": "05:05:06", "text": "但是，是的，如果有些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18309.59, "timestamp": "05:05:09", "text": "关注我，从那次合作开始，现在我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18311.75, "timestamp": "05:05:11", "text": "如果您也能支持，我将不胜感激。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18314.55, "timestamp": "05:05:14", "text": "她，还可以看她的直播，或者只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18317.75, "timestamp": "05:05:17", "text": "就像进去，进入她的聊天室，然后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18319.868, "timestamp": "05:05:19", "text": "打个招呼什么的。她会读书"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18324.23, "timestamp": "05:05:24", "text": "英语。她正在学习英语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18325.75, "timestamp": "05:05:25", "text": "这就是我们能够联系上的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18328.39, "timestamp": "05:05:28", "text": "因为她现在正在学习英语，而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18330.15, "timestamp": "05:05:30", "text": "能够联系上，并且知道她知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18332.628, "timestamp": "05:05:32", "text": "关于跳过等等。所有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18336.55, "timestamp": "05:05:36", "text": "表情包。她喜欢玩梗图。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18339.139, "timestamp": "05:05:39", "author": "@Anti-SpiritArt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/wYaIbwf481rN5bfgaxWnbUoh-faRynKzhqgZXK5WIvlx9DlMJJl0M6boNmqYwDkmuSY99pM-=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ohh okay have to do two raids then 👍"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18339.51, "timestamp": "05:05:39", "text": "虽然我恰恰相反，但我并不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18343.67, "timestamp": "05:05:43", "text": "理解他的痛苦。我进去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18346.15, "timestamp": "05:05:46", "text": "深入思考，比如为什么它好笑？为什么会这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18349.75, "timestamp": "05:05:49", "text": "与其一笑置之，不如这样处理？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18351.83, "timestamp": "05:05:51", "text": "他们随后进行了两次突袭。不，没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18353.91, "timestamp": "05:05:53", "text": "就像，你可以像这样，我们会有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18356.948, "timestamp": "05:05:56", "text": "这是多表关联，对吧？所以你